<h3 id="portfolio">Projects (Portfolio)</h3>
<p>Install and activate <b>Portfolio Post Type</b> from <b>Appearance &gt; Install Plugins</b>. Add items in the Portfolio menu and fill in the <b>Project details and gallery</b> fields in each item's editor. These fields require Advanced Custom Fields and its Repeater add-on.</p>
<p>Add the <b>Portfolio Grid</b> widget to a page using SiteOrigin Page Builder to display your items.</p>
<p>In <strong>Appearance &gt; Customize &gt; [PT] Theme Options &gt; Portfolio</strong>, set the singular name shown on project pages (for example in <b>Project Info</b> and <b>Next Project</b>), the URL slug and the number of gallery columns. This section appears when Portfolio Post Type is active. After you change the slug, open <strong>Settings &gt; Permalinks</strong> and click <strong>Save Changes</strong>.</p>

